只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Lexmount Browser plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).","id":"gh:1336859521","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-browser","slug":"lexmount/dsh-browser","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Lexmount Browser plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# `@lexmount/dsh-browser`"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Lexmount cloud browser tools for DeepSeek Harness. This package is a lightweight DSH Bundle: it regi"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"sters native model tools and invokes the Rust `browser-cli`, but it does not contain a native execut"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"able, run an MCP server, or depend on the Lexmount Node.js SDK."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Status: Windows x64, macOS Apple Silicon, and Linux x64 native validation is complete. The current"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" stable Bundle version is `0.1.1`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Current platform support:** Windows x64, macOS Apple Silicon, and Linux x64. macOS Intel and Lin"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ux ARM64 are not currently supported."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Runtime architecture"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The Bundle registers tools without accessing the network. On the first tool call it selects the curr"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ent OS/CPU asset, downloads the pinned `browser-cli` release and `SHA256SUMS` from Lexmount's versio"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ned Tencent COS path, verifies the digest, executable format/architecture, and CLI version, then ins"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"talls it atomically in a user cache. Later calls and restarts reuse the verified cache, so an alread"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"y populated cache works offline."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The npm tarball contains no `browser-cli` or `browser-cli.exe` file. End users do not need Rust, Pyt"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"hon, a browser driver, or an npm lifecycle script."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Platform status"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Host | Release asset target | Current status |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Windows x64 | `x86_64-pc-windows-msvc` | Supported |\n| macOS Apple Silicon | `aarch64-apple-darwin"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"` | Supported |\n| Linux x64 | `x86_64-unknown-linux-musl` | Supported |\n| macOS Intel | `x86_64-appl"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"e-darwin` | Not currently supported; asset missing |\n| Linux ARM64 | — | Not currently supported; as"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ot currently supported; asset missing |\n| Linux ARM64 | — | Not currently supported; asset missing |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"`native-source.json` pins `browser-cli` v1.1.15 at commit `952a5e53ff9dd3980342d4dae7f860f80b39a100`"},{"id":"p13s2","text":". The Windows asset statically links the C runtime, and the Linux x64 asset is a static musl executa"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ble. This Bundle uses the three assets published by that immutable release. Adding another platform "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"requires a new browser-cli version and a new npm package version with fresh validation; it will not "},{"id":"p13s5","text":"mutate this release in place."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The current release requires Node.js `>=22.14.0`, DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`, and a\n`pnpm` executable on `PATH"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`. The commands below use `npx`, so a global DSH\ninstallation is not required. The commands pin the "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"Bundle version so DSH's\ndependency release-age policy cannot resolve the request to an older release"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"undle version so DSH's\ndependency release-age policy cannot resolve the request to an older release."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Windows x64"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Open a normal, non-administrator PowerShell in the directory that should become\nthe DSH workspace, t"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ormal, non-administrator PowerShell in the directory that should become\nthe DSH workspace, then run:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"If `corepack enable pnpm` reports an access error under\n`C:\\Program Files\\nodejs`, run only the Core"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"pack setup commands once from an\nadministrator PowerShell, close it, and run DSH itself as the norma"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"l user. If\nport `3080` is already occupied, start DSH on an OS-assigned free port and open\nthe URL i"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"f\nport `3080` is already occupied, start DSH on an OS-assigned free port and open\nthe URL it prints:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### macOS Apple Silicon"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"This release supports Apple Silicon only. Confirm that the machine reports\n`arm64`; `x86_64` means a"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"n Intel Mac and is not currently supported. In\nTerminal, change to the directory that should become "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"the DSH workspace, then\nrun:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"If port `3080` is already occupied, use an OS-assigned free port and open the\nprinted URL:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Linux x64"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Confirm that the machine reports `x86_64`, then run:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If port `3080` is already occupied, use an OS-assigned free port and open the\nprinted URL:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"DSH RC.6 delegates plugin installation to a `pnpm` executable on `PATH`; it does\nnot bundle that exe"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"cutable. If Corepack cannot create the shim, install pnpm\nthrough the normal Node package-manager se"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"tup and verify `pnpm --version`\nfirst."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"If DSH was already running while the Bundle was installed or updated, stop and\nrestart it before tes"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ting. Package installation does not hot-load a new Bundle\ninto an existing Web process."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"For unattended use, install the same Bundle into the Headless profile:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The supported Harness range is `>=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.2.0`. DSH remains a release\ncandidate, so each DSH u"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"pgrade requires installation and tool-registration\nregression testing."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## First use and cache"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"1. Run `lexmount_doctor`. The first call may download the current platform executable.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Security and behavior"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- Downloads use a fixed HTTPS origin and version path. The matching `SHA256SUMS` entry, executable f"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ormat, platform architecture, expected CLI version, and cache metadata are verified before execution"},{"id":"p39s3","text":".\n- A cancelled first call cancels its download when no other call is waiting. Plugin disposal cance"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"ls downloads and terminates owned child processes.\n- Model input is passed as a child-process argume"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"nt array with `shell: false`; it is never concatenated into a shell command.\n- API keys, Authorizati"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"on fields, `ws`, and Chrome DevTools WebSocket URLs are removed from returned data and diagnostics.\n"},{"id":"p39s7","text":"- Tool guidance tells the model to obtain user confirmation before purchases, publication, destructi"},{"id":"p39s8","text":"ve remote actions, and account/security changes.\n- JavaScript evaluation and raw CDP remain model-vi"},{"id":"p39s9","text":"sible for advanced browser automation."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"DSH RC.6 does not expose MCP-style side-effect annotations on native tools. UI presentation categori"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"es are not permission enforcement."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Known browser-cli limitations"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The first release intentionally retains the existing browser-cli behavior:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- URL, form value, JavaScript, metadata, and raw CDP params are visible in local process argv;\n- eac"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"h action connects independently and selects the first page target;\n- ordinary interaction is limited"},{"id":"p43s3","text":" to wait, click, and fill; there is no ACE, hover, press, select, check, drag, or file upload;\n- CDP"},{"id":"p43s4","text":" commands do not have complete internal deadlines or reconnect/replay behavior;\n- snapshot returns c"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"omplete page text and HTML;\n- credential writes and Windows ACL behavior are unchanged;\n- Windows bi"},{"id":"p43s6","text":"naries are not Authenticode-signed in the first release;\n- output paths are not restricted by an add"},{"id":"p43s7","text":"itional plugin sandbox."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
